{
  "uid": "availability",
  "title": "Availability",
  "tags": [
    "player-service"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 4,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Craft demo \u2014 availability ramp",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## What this dashboard shows (branch JVM only, :8080)\n\nOne process. Each series appears **once**.\n\n| Series | Meaning |\n|--------|---------|\n| **busy** | Tomcat workers currently inside a request (`tomcat_threads_busy_threads`) |\n| **max configured** | Pool cap, dashed orange (`tomcat_threads_config_max_threads`, pinned to **40**) |\n\nWhen **busy** sits on **max configured**, new player calls wait or time out. Bars under each API are **completed** responses in the scrape interval (200 / 503 / 500 / other 5xx). Client timeouts never become a bar \u2014 the request never finished on the server.\n\nPagination load comparison is the other dashboard: **Pagination \u2014 load (main vs paged)**.\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Tomcat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tomcat busy threads (workers serving a request)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "max configured"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.lineStyle",
                "value": {
                  "dash": [
                    10,
                    10
                  ],
                  "fill": "dash"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "fixedColor": "orange",
                  "mode": "fixed"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max(tomcat_threads_busy_threads{deployment=\"branch\"})",
          "legendFormat": "busy"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "max(tomcat_threads_config_max_threads{deployment=\"branch\"})",
          "legendFormat": "max configured"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "GET /v1/players",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Completed requests (count in interval)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 80,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(http_server_requests_seconds_count{deployment=\"branch\",uri=\"/v1/players\",method=\"GET\",status=\"200\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "200"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum(increase(http_server_requests_seconds_count{deployment=\"branch\",uri=\"/v1/players\",method=\"GET\",status=\"503\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "503"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "sum(increase(http_server_requests_seconds_count{deployment=\"branch\",uri=\"/v1/players\",method=\"GET\",status=\"500\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "500"
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "expr": "sum(increase(http_server_requests_seconds_count{deployment=\"branch\",uri=\"/v1/players\",method=\"GET\",status=\"502\"}[$__rate_interval])) + sum(increase(http_server_requests_seconds_count{deployment=\"branch\",uri=\"/v1/players\",method=\"GET\",status=\"504\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "other 5xx"
        }
      ]
    },
